# Everything is left out of an image unless it is listed below. An image is as public as the
# repository, and a folder that holds a library also holds its data (.library/), its keys (.env)
# and the repository's history (.git). Listing what goes in, instead of what stays out, means a
# new private file can never be picked up by accident.
